<title>USA: Columbus, Ohio, $32 mln bonds won by ABN Amro.</title>
<headline>Columbus, Ohio, $32 mln bonds won by ABN Amro.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Securities said Tuesday it won $32.4 million of Columbus, Ohio, various purpose limited tax bonds, Series 1996-1, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 4.7165 percent.</p>
</text>
